          "index": 0,
          "text": "if %goal.Step.IsCached%, return",
          "line": {
            "number": 34
          },
          "comment": "The three stages for the goal in %goal% — shared by the top goal and every sub-goal. The decider\nanswers WHICH actions a step may use; the LLM writes each step's actions in formal; the steps read\nthe answer, each checking its own line, and take their code. A step refused goes back to the LLM\nalone; an else written apart from its if is the programmer's to fix, not the LLM's.\nSteps that are all cached have nothing to ask.",
          "code": [
            {
              "module": "condition",
              "name": "if",
              "property": [
